      "x": 6960,
      "y": 37705,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 252,
      "text": "### Condition confirmed\n\nUnsafe construction is confirmed: use only the required bounded effect.\n\n**Verify:** Require source/configuration evidence for the loader and an attributable effect; a .yml extension is insufficient.\n\n[[notes/web-exploitation.md#web-yaml|Full note & variants]]",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
