      "x": 6960,
      "y": 39134,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 276,
      "text": "### Condition confirmed\n\nThe bounded command effect repeats only with the crafted environment function: select the route.\n\n**Verify:** Require command-derived output distinct from reflected header text and record the CGI identity.\n\n[[notes/web-exploitation.md#web-shellshock|Full note & variants]]",
