      "width": 2300,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "# 03 Web\n\nAll workflows, commands, result interpretations and method connections for this track are on this canvas. Embedded notes contain the complete procedures and variants.\n\n[[START.canvas|Choose another track]]\n\nCross-track results link directly to the receiving track."
    }
